OL,3,GNEWSAJury reaches unanimous findings at
OL,4,ANoah Donohoe inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury at the inquest into the death
OL,7,Fof Belfast schoolboy Noah Donohoe have
OL,8,Freached unanimous findings.
OL,10,FThe foreman of the jury informed the
OL,11,Fcourt on Tuesday that they have
OL,12,Fcompleted their deliberations.
OL,14,FThe coroner Mr Justice Rooney is now
OL,15,Fconsidering their findings before the
OL,16,Fverdict is delivered to the court.
OL,18,FThe breakthrough came on the fifth day
OL,19,Fof jury deliberations.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
